{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "91a73d92-671c-803f-a890-9159e56558ba",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T11:59:05-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:56:16-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:56:20-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. This is Jorge Souza. I am calling about the water in my yard again. It comes every time it rains and nobody does nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:56:30-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry to hear that. Let me grab some details. What's the address, Mr. Souza?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:56:36-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "317 Kay Street, up in the Historic Hill. [line breaks up] you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:56:42-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got 317 Kay Street, you broke up a little after that. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:56:48-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. The water, it runs down the hill from the next street, all the way down, and goes straight into my yard. Straight in. After the rain that ended Saturday, two days ago, it was standing there all Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:57:02-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So runoff coming downhill from the street above and pooling in your yard. Is it a storm drain that's backed up, do you know, or just the water coming down the slope?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:57:14-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't know this. I see the water come, it does not go in nothing. The drain, [inaudible] maybe it is full, maybe not working. That is why I want somebody to look. This is not the first time, you understand. Every big rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:57:29-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, no, I hear you. I'm writing down, runoff from the upper street, into the yard at 317, recurring. Do you have any pictures?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:57:38-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I took photos, many photos, Saturday and Sunday. I can send them to you. Tell me where."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:57:45-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll have to get you the right place for that. Let me put you on a quick hold, make sure I give you the right way to send them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:57:55-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:57:57-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ei, kuza ki bu ta fazi li? Nha primu ta ben pa leba karu? [crosstalk] Sim, ainda nu ta spera. Okay, sorry, I am here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:58:06-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I'm back. Sounds like you've got company."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:58:10-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My cousin is borrowing my car, I am waiting for him to bring it back. That is all. Now, who do I call to get this checked? Somebody has to come look at the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:58:22-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be our office here, we send it to the crew that looks at drainage. I'll put in a request for an inspection at 317 Kay Street. Can I confirm a callback number, in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:58:36-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. 401-555-0169."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:58:38-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0169. Perfect. And for the photos, once I have the right address for them, I'll have somebody call you with it, or you can mention them when the crew calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:58:49-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. But I hope somebody really comes this time. I am tired of the water in my yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:58:56-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in the system now, and I noted it keeps happening. You'll hear from us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T11:59:02-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Kevin. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
